        "date": "2023-03-17",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-2.0",
        "observations": "Inspected960×641 street frontage:large pale rectangular frame,gold perforated spandrels forming a broad round arch,tall pale vertical ribs,recessed glazing,arched flanking fields and ground bays,and a small roof cupola. The model uses an original coarse mesh pattern,not copied decorative art or inscriptions."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Baitul_Futuh.jpg",
        "author": "Muffingg / Muffinll;current file enhanced by Ceddyfresse",
        "date": "2006 EXIF/upload;description lists2007",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "observations": "Inspected1600×1200 overview to resolve the hall/turret arrangement missing from the frontal and dome-only views. Pale angular hall,grey rectangular stone fields,tall rectangular glazing,round ground arcades,silver dome and glazed octagonal roof turrets with small domes are visible. Used only for the older prayer-hall vocabulary,not the new street frontage. Date metadata is inconsistent and does not establish present condition."
      },
      {
        "page": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Baitul_Futuh_dome.jpg",
        "author": "Muffingg / Muffinll",
        "date": "2006 EXIF/upload;description lists2007",
        "license": "Public domain",
        "observations": "Inspected1600×1200 dome close-up:silver shallow hemisphere,standing seams/ribs and a tall spindle finial above pale flat roof edges. Neighbor brickwork and overhead wires are excluded. Date metadata is inconsistent."
